OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FJudge Mr Justice Calver told jurors to
OL,8,Fcontinue their deliberations and said
OL,9,Fhe would accept majority verdicts -
OL,10,Fmeaning at least 10 of the 12 jurors
OL,11,Fmust agree
